{
  "element": "cds-content-list-item",
  "defaults": {
    "kind": "default",
    "label": "Label",
    "description": "Description",
    "show-description": "true",
    "show-lead-item": "true",
    "show-divider": "true",
    "lead-icon": "placeholder-line",
    "intent": "default",
    "trailing-item": "checkbox",
    "show-trailing-item": "true",
    "show-tag": "true",
    "tag-label": "Tag",
    "shaped-icon": "placeholder-line",
    "value": "30.000,00",
    "symbol": "R$",
    "value-description": "Description",
    "show-navigation-indicator": "true"
  },
  "jsx": {
    "tag": "ContentList.Item",
    "props": [
      {
        "prop": "kind",
        "attr": "kind"
      },
      {
        "prop": "intent",
        "attr": "intent",
        "if": {
          "intent": "!default"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "label",
        "attr": "label"
      },
      {
        "prop": "description",
        "attr": "description",
        "if": {
          "show-description": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "leadIcon",
        "attr": "lead-icon",
        "if": {
          "show-lead-item": "true",
          "intent": "!transaction"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "leadIcon",
        "attr": "shaped-icon",
        "if": {
          "intent": "transaction"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "hideLeadItem",
        "attr": "show-lead-item",
        "bool": "not"
      },
      {
        "prop": "trailingItem",
        "attr": "trailing-item",
        "map": {
          "chechbox": "checkbox",
          "radio-button": "radio"
        },
        "if": {
          "intent": "default",
          "show-trailing-item": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "hideTrailingItem",
        "attr": "show-trailing-item",
        "bool": "not",
        "if": {
          "intent": "default"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "trailingTag",
        "attr": "tag-label",
        "expr": "{ children: '{v}' }",
        "if": {
          "intent": "navigation",
          "show-tag": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "trailingText",
        "expr": "{ currency: '{@symbol} {@value}', description: '{@value-description}' }",
        "if": {
          "intent": "transaction"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "divider",
        "attr": "show-divider",
        "bool": true,
        "if": {
          "kind": "!card"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "href",
        "attr": "href"
      },
      {
        "prop": "disabled",
        "attr": "disabled",
        "bool": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "figma": [
    [
      "Kind",
      "kind",
      "kind",
      ""
    ],
    [
      "Intent",
      "intent",
      "intent",
      "`default`, `navigation` ou `transaction`; cada um troca o trailing."
    ],
    [
      "State",
      "disabled",
      "disabled",
      "Só Disabled vira prop."
    ],
    [
      "Show Lead Item",
      "show-lead-item",
      "hideLeadItem",
      "Invertido: desligado = `hideLeadItem`. O ícone vai em `leadIcon` (no Transaction, o Shaped Icon)."
    ],
    [
      "Show Trailing Item",
      "show-trailing-item",
      "trailingItem / hideTrailingItem",
      "Intent Default: o controle (`checkbox`, `radio`, `switch` ou `icon`) vai em `trailingItem`; o estado, em `trailingItemProps`."
    ],
    [
      "Show Tag",
      "show-tag + tag-label",
      "trailingTag",
      "Intent Navigation: `{ children }` da Tag (Warning por padrão)."
    ],
    [
      "Show Navigation Indicator",
      "show-navigation-indicator",
      "—",
      "O chevron aparece sozinho nos Intents Navigation e Transaction."
    ],
    [
      "Show Divider",
      "show-divider",
      "divider",
      "O padrão do Figma é ligado; o do React, desligado — declare `divider`. Ignorado no Card."
    ],
    [
      "—",
      "value + symbol + value-description",
      "trailingText",
      "Intent Transaction: `{ currency, description }` (o valor vai já formatado, com o sinal)."
    ]
  ]
}
